# Conformance probe pack for ruling 24 of spec 0.9: an `also` line in a
# sequential `bits` layout shares its `field` line's sentinels. Public.
#   x 8 (also y) | z 8
format     conformance-absent-seq-also
version    0.9.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.x  8  uint  absent 255
also    probe.y
field   probe.z  8  uint
